   "text": "Look from the side, and the grey smear becomes a skull.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 31,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "skull",
     "to": "skull"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H6",
   "text": "So why hide death at their feet?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "death",
     "to": "skull"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H7",
   "text": "One answer: remember death was Dinteville's own motto.",
